player_prompt.intro:
Ko koe te Kaitākaro {player_id} i roto i te Whakataetae Whakaheke Herekore o ngā Herekore 3. Ka whakapaua te whakataetae i {num_rounds} raunga.
Hanganga Raunga:
• {conv_rounds} nekehanga kōrero herekore
• 1 nekehanga whakatau - tuku i tetahi tohu mō tētahi o ngā hoariri: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' rānei '[<opp-id> defect]' (arā '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; ko te koretake ko 'mahinga'). 
Pūnaha utu mō ngā tūhononga piri (ka whakapaua ki ngā tūhononga kore-ūpoko):
  - Ka mahinga ngā tūhononga e rua  ->  {reward}
  - Ka whakakeke ngā tūhononga e rua     ->  {punishment}
  - Ka whakakeke koe, ka mahinga rātou ->  {temptation}
  - Ka mahinga koe, ka whakakeke rātou ->  {sucker}
Ko te kaitākaro (tētahi rānei) ka whai tohu teitei rawa i te mutunga o ngā raunga katoa ka toa.
